    </div>
    <div class="about-text">
      <p>I am <strong>Preeti Sachdeva</strong>, Founder of <strong>Parenting With Preeti</strong>. With over 15 years in the education sector, I have served as a <strong>Teacher and Academic Head</strong> in schools, shaping the academic foundations of thousands of young minds.</p>
      <p>As a <strong>Certified Parenting Coach, DMIT Practitioner, and NLP Coach</strong>, I am on a mission to help parents and children overcome learning challenges through personalized counselling, memory enhancement sessions, and parenting workshops.</p>
      <p>I am also a passionate <strong>Content Writer for Academics</strong> and author of <strong>"The User Manual for Your Mind"</strong> — an NLP guide for teens, and <strong>"Train Your Brain"</strong> — a memory enhancement guide, both available on Amazon.</p>
      <p>My approach combines scientific understanding of the brain with practical, empathetic coaching to bring out the best in every child.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
